# Domain model first

When refactoring domain beings (Spirit, Soul, Heaven, Earth, Man, …):

- Preserve stated invariants and comments (who may reach whom, who constructs whom).
- Prefer a slightly longer path that keeps the model over a shorter one that breaks it
  (e.g. friend/bypass, public accessors “just for this call”).
- If a static lookup or helper is needed, put it on the type that already owns the
  relationship (Spirit→Heaven), not by widening friendship or visibility.
- Before landing a fix, check: does this still match the ontological story in the
  headers? If not, redesign the access path.
